<P>
These are Fiat specialists and Abarth agents. They also know about
the 16V Tipo which, as most of us will have found out, FIAT garages
typically don't. They are very well
established and often offer advice and help without any cost. They are
trained Fiat technicians and you often find them advertised in
Auto Italia magazine. If possible speak to Jeff.




