<P>
These guys are extremely helpful and knowledgeable. They sell the following
items for the FIAT Tipo:<BR><BR>

<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLPADDING="5" CELLSPACING="0">
<TR>
<TD><FONT COLOR="80FF80">Lowered Springs</FONT></TD><TD>
        Lowers car by 30mm and cost &pound;149 (Part# F02.70.130)</TD>
</TR><TR>
<TD><FONT COLOR="80FF80">Interior Kit</FONT></TD><TD>
        This is a 17 part kit that sticks over the existing interior. It is
        available in Briarwood, Mahogany, Aluminium, Carbon Fibre or
        Titanium Look and costs &pound;120. It is unfortunately only
        available for 5 door Tipos although I'm not sure how different
        the interiors are. Maybe some of the 5 door interior would fit in
        the 3 door?
        </TD>
</TR><TR>
<TD><FONT COLOR="80FF80">Exhaust Systems</FONT></TD><TD>
        These are SuperSprint systems which are true OEM replacements. They
        also have Catalytic converter replacements which add several bhp.</TD>
</TR><TR>
<TD><FONT COLOR="80FF80">Spoilers</FONT></TD><TD>
        <IMG SRC="rear_spoiler2.jpg" ALIGN=RIGHT WIDTH=214 HEIGHT=140 ALT="Rear Spoiler">
        These are both MS Design products. One fits on the roof above
        the rear tailgate complete with brake light and costs
        &pound;145 (Part# F02DF/11).
        <BR CLEAR=ALL>
        <IMG SRC="rear_spoiler1.jpg" ALIGN=LEFT WIDTH=218 HEIGHT=132 ALT="Rear Spoiler">
        The other fits half way up
        the rear tailgate without a brakelight and costs &pound;120 (Part# F02HFT).
        </TD>
</TR><TR>
<TD><FONT COLOR="80FF80">Body Kits</FONT></TD><TD>
        Again these are MS Design products. A replacement front bumper costs &pound;200 (Part# F02V), a replacement rear
        bumper costs &pound;145 (Part# F02H) and a pair of side skirts &pound;230 (Part# F02LR). Buying
        the whole lot together saves &pound;55 bringing the total price to
        &pound;520. Please note the rear roof spoilers are extra. Apparently the bodykit accepts the SuperSprint exhaust.<BR><BR>
        <IMG SRC="5door_kit.jpg" ALIGN=LEFT WIDTH=302 HEIGHT=132 ALT="5 Door Kit">
        <BR CLEAR=ALL><BR>
        <IMG SRC="3door_kit.jpg" ALIGN=RIGHT WIDTH=302 HEIGHT=138 ALT="3 Door Kit">
        </TD>
</TR>
</TABLE>

